<title>SINGAPORE: HP to invest S$80 mln in Singapore R&amp;D -TV.</title>
<headline>HP to invest S$80 mln in Singapore R&amp;D -TV.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Singapore expects to invest about Singapore $80 million in research and development in the city state over the next five years, state television said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said HP Singapore made the commitment after clinching the charter to develop, manufacture and market a new A-3 printer for the global market.</p>
<p>HP said in a statement it expects the wide-format inkjet printer market to reach S$3 billion by the year 2001.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
